[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 STRP (Software Transition Plan)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Software Test Report
STATEMENT: The system shall generate comprehensive test reports documenting test results and coverage.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Metrics
STATEMENT: The system shall track and report test metrics including pass/fail rates and coverage statistics.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Defect Tracking
STATEMENT: The system shall track and manage defects through resolution and verification.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STRP-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Test Summary
STATEMENT: The system shall provide executive summaries of test results and recommendations.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.